Kitty terminal shortcuts and helpers.

Shell integration
	ctrl+shift+g - Open the last command output in Neovim
	ctrl+shift+s - Browse/search scrollback with kitty-scrollback.nvim
	ctrl+shift+z / ctrl+shift+x - Jump to previous/next shell prompt
	right-click command output - Select that command's complete output
	alt+a - Pick a past command's output from full scrollback and copy it
	clone-in-kitty - Clone the current shell, directory and environment
	clone-in-kitty --type=tab - Clone the current shell into a tab
	edit-in-kitty FILE - Edit a file in a separate Kitty window
	kitten run-shell - Start a nested shell with Kitty integration
	kitten ssh HOST - SSH with terminfo and shell integration
	kssh HOST - Short alias for kitten ssh
	kitten transfer FILE DEST - Transfer files through an SSH terminal
	edit-in-kitty FILE - Edit a remote file locally and sync it back

Windows, tabs and layouts
	ctrl+b - Enter tmux-compatible prefix mode
	ctrl+b c / & - New/close tab (tmux window)
	ctrl+b n / p / b - Next/previous/last-used tab
	ctrl+b 1..9 - Select tab by number
	ctrl+b , / < / > - Rename/move tab left/move tab right
	ctrl+b % or | / " or - - Split left-right/top-bottom
	ctrl+b h/j/k/l - Focus pane left/down/up/right
	ctrl+b H/J/K/L - Resize pane by five cells
	ctrl+b x / z - Close/maximize active pane
	ctrl+b o / ; / q - Next/last-used/visually select pane
	ctrl+b space - Cycle tmux-style preset pane layouts
	ctrl+b alt+1..7 - Select a tmux-style preset pane layout
	ctrl+b [ / ] - Browse scrollback/paste clipboard
	ctrl+shift+enter - New pane in the current directory
	ctrl+shift+t - New tab in the current directory
	ctrl+shift+h/j/k/l - Focus pane left/down/up/right
	ctrl+shift+backslash - Cycle layouts
	ctrl+shift+f10 - Maximize/restore the active pane
	ctrl+shift+right / ctrl+shift+left - Next/previous tab
	ctrl+shift+r - Enter pane resize mode

Hints and selection
	ctrl+shift+e - Select and open a visible URL
	ctrl+shift+p, then f - Select a visible path
	ctrl+shift+p, then l - Select a visible line
	ctrl+shift+p, then w - Select a visible word
	ctrl+shift+p, then y - Open a visible terminal hyperlink
	ctrl+shift+u - Unicode and emoji picker

Configuration and tools
	ctrl+shift+f2 - Edit kitty.conf
	ctrl+shift+f5 - Reload kitty.conf
	ctrl+shift+f6 - Show config errors/debug information
	ctrl+shift+plus / ctrl+shift+minus - Increase/decrease font size
	kitten themes - Interactive theme selector
	kitten icat IMAGE - Display an image in the terminal
	icat IMAGE - Short alias for kitten icat
	knotify COMMAND... - Run a command and notify when it finishes
	kcopy / kpaste - Write/read the desktop clipboard through Kitty
	kitten quick-access-terminal - Toggle Kitty's native dropdown terminal
	kitty --session ~/.config/kitty/sessions/work.conf - Start the work session
	kitten @ --to unix:@kitty ls - Inspect Kitty through its control socket
